OL,3,GNEWSAYoung athletes to lose indoor
OL,4,Atrack to new gym
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity says hundreds of young people
OL,7,Fwill have nowhere to train in winter
OL,8,Fafter a council decided to turn an
OL,9,Findoor athletics track in north-west
OL,10,FLondon into a gym.
OL,12,FBrent Council plans to redevelop the
OL,13,Ftrack at Willesden Sports Centre as
OL,14,Fpart of a #1.4m upgrade it says will
OL,15,Fcreate more gym space.
OL,17,FTrack Academy, which runs three
OL,18,Fsessions a week for people aged five to
OL,19,F23, said it was told in June that the
OL,20,Ftrack would close within weeks.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
