OL,3,GNEWSAYoung athletes to lose indoor
OL,4,Atrack to new gym
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatrik Ewe, who runs the charity, said
OL,7,Fthe track was "a vital safe space for
OL,8,Four community" and that the council had
OL,9,Fnot provided a suitable alternative to
OL,10,Fthe indoor space.
